  <title>Gibson Island Green H2</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/gibson-island-green-h2</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/gibson-island-green-h2" hreflang="en"&gt;Gibson Island Green H2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;550 MW Electrolyzers &lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;for Green Hydrogen production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Standardized 110 MW block design that is repeatable and adaptable for multiple project sizes and locations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pre-FEED and FEED services for developing an optimized Balance of Plant (BOP) design surrounding a 10MW electrolyzer Balance of System (BOS). The objective of the project was to design standard blocks for roll-out across the client's portfolio of projects, supporting their decarbonization and green product export agendas. This involved developing a portfolio of projects centered on the production of renewable energy and other value-added green export products, primarily hydrogen and ammonia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Low Carbon Hydrogen &amp;amp; Ammonia&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2026-01/Gibson%20Island%20Green%20H2.jpg.webp?itok=fUMtb6w2" width="864" height="576" alt="Gibson Island Green H2" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


