<item>
  <title>Stegra</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/stegra-0</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/stegra-0" hreflang="en"&gt;Stegra&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;740MW&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;green hydrogen manufacturing plant&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;95% lower&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;carbon emissions than conventional steel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;One of the world’s largest electrolysis plants&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;Integration and optimization of a safe, cost-effective hydrogen plant&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li dir="ltr"&gt;740MW green hydrogen manufacturing plant as part of a new green steel facility close to the Arctic Circle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stegra was created with the purpose of leading a clean industrial revolution starting with steel. The company’s first plant is currently under construction in Boden. Green steel will have 95% lower carbon emissions than conventional steel. Our scope of work includes EPCm services for the steel mill project, hydrogen manufacturing plant, water treatment plants 1 &amp;amp; 2 and the slag handling unit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Low Carbon Hydrogen &amp;amp; Ammonia&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2026-02/Stegra%20Project_2.jpg.webp?itok=23rHhIHf" width="864" height="576" alt="Stegra" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

