<item>
  <title>EVREC P2X Green Ammonia Plant</title>
  <link>https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/evrec-p2x-green-ammonia-plant</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/projects/evrec-p2x-green-ammonia-plant" hreflang="en"&gt;EVREC P2X Green Ammonia Plant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;div class="field field--name-field-project-metrics field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;165kta&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;hydrogen production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;  &lt;div class="paragraph paragraph--type--metrics paragraph--view-mode--default"&gt;
          
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-metric-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;5000 MT&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-metric-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;daily&amp;nbsp;ammonia production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
      &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
  


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-highlights field--type-text-long field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Highlights&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Includes the development of up to 530-turbine wind farm with the ability to generate 3.5GW of electricity and 150MW solar photovoltaic&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Island operation includes hydrogen storage and Battery Energy Storage System (BESS)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-project-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project involves Front-End Engineering Design (FEED), execution planning and Total Installed Cost (TIC) estimate. The facility includes two production trains powered entirely by renewable energy to produce green ammonia through water electrolysis, generating green hydrogen. This hydrogen will be combined with nitrogen from air separation units to synthesize ammonia via the Haber-Bosch process. Renewable electricity will be produced from dedicated wind and solar farms. The facility also includes a jetty and storage systems to enable bulk ammonia export.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-solutions-category field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;Low Carbon Hydrogen &amp;amp; Ammonia&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-spotlight-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;  &lt;img loading="eager" src="https://www.dodsalgroup.com/sites/default/files/styles/webp/public/2024-11/Exploits%20Valley%20Renewable%20Spotlight.jpg.webp?itok=g8cPmUrg" width="864" height="576" alt="Exploits Valley Renewable Energy Corporation (EVREC)" class="image-style-webp"&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
      
  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-location field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Canada&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-scope field--type-string field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Scope&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Early Contractor Involvement&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
